None of these components are redistributed in this repository. They are fetched
at build time by build/fetch-components.ps1, which pins each one to a verified
SHA256 checksum. A bundle assembled by build/build-bundle.ps1 contains a
summary of these licences in dist/bundle/LICENSES/COMPONENTS.txt.

